  ... Let ``typeIR~index~`` be <<typeof_expression, the type of  ``typedExpressionIR~index~``>>
  ... Let ``ctk~index~`` be <<ctkof_expression, the compile-time known-ness of  ``typedExpressionIR~index~``>>
