. Else if ``declaration`` has type ``controlTypeDeclaration``
 .. Let ``annotationList CONTROL name typeParameterListOpt ( parameterList ) ;`` be ``declaration``
 .. Group controlTypeDeclaration: ``GLOBAL``, ``TC~0~``, and ``annotationList CONTROL name typeParameterListOpt ( parameterList ) ;``

  ... Let ``TC~1~`` be ``TC~0~``[BLOCK.KIND = ``CONTROL``]
  ... Let ``typeParameter*`` be ``$flatten_typeParameterListOpt(typeParameterListOpt)``
  ... Let ``tid_expl*`` be the list of ``tid_expl``, obtained by repeating:
