  ... Let ``typeDefIR~control~`` be ``typeIR~control~ < tid~expl~* , tid~impl~* >``
  ... If (TypeDef_wf: ``$bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~) |- typeDefIR~control~``), then
   .... Let ``TC~3~`` be ``$add_type(GLOBAL, TC~0~, nameIR, typeDefIR~control~)``
   .... Let ``controlTypeDeclarationIR`` be ``annotationList CONTROL nameIR < tid~expl~* , tid~impl~* > ( parameterIR* ) ;``
   .... Result in ``TC~3~`` and ``controlTypeDeclarationIR``

. Else if ``declaration`` has type ``packageTypeDeclaration``
