   .... Let ``TC~3~`` be ``$add_type(GLOBAL, TC~0~, nameIR, polyTypeDefIR~package~)``
   .... Let ``cid`` be ``$cid(name, ( parameterList ))``
   .... Let ``typeIR~package_spec~`` be ``polyTypeDefIR~package~ < TID tid~expl~* ++ TID tid~impl~* >``
   .... Let ``constructorTypeIR`` be ``CONSTRUCTOR ( constructorParameterTypeIR* ) -> typeIR~package_spec~``
   .... Let ``constructorTypeDefIR`` be ``constructorTypeIR < tid~expl~* , tid~impl~* >``
   .... If (ConstructorTypeDef_wf: ``$bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~) |- constructorTypeDefIR``), then
    ..... Let ``TC~4~`` be ``$add_constructor(TC~3~, cid, constructorTypeDefIR)``
    ..... Let ``packageTypeDeclarationIR`` be ``annotationList PACKAGE nameIR < tid~expl~* , tid~impl~* > ( constructorParameterIR* ) ;``
    ..... Result in ``TC~4~`` and ``packageTypeDeclarationIR``

